  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/94a3ba98fe537b71a0cedca8cdf679aea0668b950fa8b6ddc2ea6c6e99a6adff.png] \n\n1. ÷ × ×\n\n__**20 ÷ 4**__ × 8 10 × 5\n\n⇒ 5 × 8 __**10 **____**× 5**__\n\n⇒ __**5**____** ×**____** 8**__ \n\n⇒ 40 \n\n2. ÷ + = ×\n\n__**20 ÷ 4**__ + 8 = 10 × 5\n\n⇒ 5 + 8 = __**10 **____**× 5**__\n\n⇒ __**5**____** +**____** 8**__ = 50\n\n⇒ 13 ≠ 50\n\n3. ÷ × > ×\n\n__**20 ÷ 4**__ × 8 > 10 × 5\n\n⇒ 5 × 8 > __**10 × 5**__\n\n⇒ __**5**____** × 8**__ > 50\n\n⇒ 40 > 50\n\n4. × ÷ > ×\n\n20 × __**4 ÷ 8**__ > 10 × 5\n\n⇒ __**20 × 0.5**__ > 10 × 5\n\n⇒ 10 > __**10 × 5**__\n\n⇒ 10 > 50\n\nHence, '**÷ × ×**' is the correct answer.",
